## When writing models files:
- Follow the format in `@class_models.py`.

## When writing migration files:
- Follow the format in `@20241202_201931_classes.py`.

## When writing seed files:
- Follow the format in `@classes.py`.
- **Do not use randomly generated data.** manually input seed data to make data appear mor natural.


